{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000db5b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0d127-0511-7921-a79b-fbe9b8416c0a"},"sequence":3080,"recorded_at":1780531400006155,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"2935b83d-2af1-400b-8bec-61864cd8ed2c","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"2935b83d-2af1-400b-8bec-61864cd8ed2c","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"2935b83d-2af1-400b-8bec-61864cd8ed2c"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0d157-6443-7652-80dd-9fbcca879f82"},"task_id":"01a0d157-6443-7652-80dd-9fbcca879f82","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0d157-6443-7652-80dd-9fbcca879f82","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 125-140\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-`testdata/mutant_harness.py` ships 117 narrowing rows plus the\n-harmless `C-doc-comment` SURVIVED control. Every narrowing weakens\n-one gate to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject,\n-and every killer drives a production entry alone. Shared gates (one\n-implementation, two call sites: the vocabulary predicates, the\n-strict frame, the member census helpers, the order helpers, the\n-DAG gate, the branch gates, the factored count gates, the modes\n-constant, the build UTF-8 helpers) carry one plant each with a\n-killer that drives the production entries; rules implemented twice\n-(build + decode) carry one plant per side. `N-strategy-route` and\n-`N-action-route` are the token-preserving attacks: the\n-searched-for token still matches while the decision changes, and\n-the killers execute the behavioral oracle suites through both\n-entries. Single-member-class rows label gates whose reject class\n-holds exactly one member. The battery runs twice with one raw log\n-per plant per run carrying the subprocess exit.\n+`testdata/mutant_harness.py` ships 123 narrowing rows, one\n+token-preserving arm-delete row (`N-dag-locality-evasion`, marked\n+NOT a narrowing in its note), and the harmless `C-doc-comment`\n+SURVIVED control. Every narrowing weakens one gate to admit exactly\n+one member of the class it must reject, and every killer drives a\n+production entry alone. Shared gates (one implementation, two call\n+sites: the vocabulary predicates, the strict frame, the member\n+census helpers, the order helpers, the DAG gate, the branch gates,\n+the factored count gates, the modes constant, the build UTF-8\n+helpers) carry one plant each with a killer that drives the\n+production entries; rules implemented twice (build + decode) carry\n+one plant per side. `N-strategy-route` and `N-action-route` are the\n+token-preserving attacks: the searched-for token still matches\n+while the decision changes, and the killers execute the behavioral\n+oracle suites through both entries. Single-member-class rows label\n+gates whose reject class holds exactly one member. The battery runs\n+twice with one raw log per plant per run carrying the subprocess\n+exit.\n","final_result":true}}}
