{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e161","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0d127-0511-7921-a79b-fbe9b8416c0a"},"sequence":3851,"recorded_at":1780531400007697,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"2935b83d-2af1-400b-8bec-61864cd8ed2c","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"2935b83d-2af1-400b-8bec-61864cd8ed2c","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"2935b83d-2af1-400b-8bec-61864cd8ed2c"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Handed off to review — TASK-260830-1jmmqn is `to-review` with all four rev1 findings answered in revision 2.\n\nWhat was delivered: rework of the `internal/cloneplan` leaf (tests + harness + TRACEABILITY only; rev1 production semantics untouched, still uncommitted, still scoped to the new package):\n\n- **member-case-variant-uncounted**: census now reflection-derived from the Go input types (nested structs, slices of structs, maps; 4 documented irregular names; synthesized members by sealed set difference), cross-checked derived-vs-sealed both ways; miscased sweep covers 6 variant classes per member; duplication covers every member via a byte-path splicer; new `TestMemberCensusNoLiteralList` AST guard (proven: planted 12-name list reddened it, removal greened it). Reviewer's Titlecase plant killed ALONE, adopted as `N-case-title-strategy`.\n- **dag-large-invalid-uncounted**: `TestDAGWholeDomainCensus` classifies every graph through 4 ops (65,856 total) against the oracle through both entries, plus every edge class at every 5-op position; `TestDAGLocalityStructure` (AST pin) + `TestDAGSingleEdgeLocality` (35 toggles) prove the per-edge-local rule; all 1024 valid 5-DAGs admit. Reviewer's 4-op self-edge plant killed ALONE, adopted as `N-dagfour-self`.\n- **entry-presence-combinations-uncounted**: full kind × 2³ presence × mode grid (48 cells) through both manifest entries with structural literals on every refuse cell, plus `TestEntryGridNeverPanics` under per-cell recovery. Reviewer's branchcombo plant killed ALONE via the panic guard, adopted as `N-entry-branch-combo`.\n- **exact-tree-diff-check-missed**: harness EOF blank line removed; scratch-index `git diff --cached --check` over the full tree exits 0 (real index untouched).\n\nAlso closed both rev1 notes: the 1M-mapping edge now seals/decodes at both production entries (`TestMappingCountMillionEntryLevel`, 31s; `N-count-mapping-max` repointed to kill there), and the importer grid is keyed (package, entry, input) with 171 owner files hash-identical base-vs-candidate and owner suites green on both.\n\nVerification observed: package suite green (96.8% coverage), full repo suite 46/46 green, `go vet` and Windows `go vet` clean, mutant battery 124 KILLED + 1 control SURVIVED across two full runs with one raw log per plant per run, `-count=3` determinism green. Measured AC coverage 18 of 18 leaf rows, each with its production call site; three bounds stated (structural 5-op coverage, guard threshold, JSON-vs-Go probe placement). All three artifacts updated on the board and read back byte-identical; evidence tar is 94KB.","reason":null}}
